{"text": "PRIVILEGED AND CONFIDENTIAL - INCIDENT\nMEMORANDUM\nTo: Howard Fennimore, Managing Partner\n\nFrom: Kofi Adjei, Ironwood IT Partners (ticket IW-88213)\n\nDate: November 14, 2025\n\nRe: Business email compromise - payment diverted from Garnet Hollow\nVineyards, LLC\n\n1. Summary\nOn Thursday, November 6, staff accountant Dominika Szabo, who runs\noutsourced accounts payable for Garnet Hollow (client no. GHV-0417), released a\nwire of $84,310.00 to an account controlled by a fraudster posing as Vireo Bottling\nSolutions Inc. A second request for $41,950 to a UK account was stopped.\nFennimore Kaplan CPAs, PLLC (\"FK\") has recovered $52,000.00 so far.\n\n2. Timeline (all times PT)\n Oct. 28 07:44 - Dominika receives a \"shared invoice\" email and enters her\npassword at https://login.micros0ft-365.example/auth?id=dszabo. No MFA\nprompt; MFA had been switched off for her mailbox during a phone migration\nin September.\n Oct. 28 07:51 - first foreign sign-in to her mailbox from 203.0.113.142 (VPN exit,\nLagos, Nigeria). An inbox rule named \"..\" starts moving anything from Vireo to\nthe RSS folder.\n Nov. 4 - attacker replies in an existing thread from ar@vireo-bottIing.example\n(the real address is ar@vireobottling.example) with \"updated remittance\ndetails\".\n Nov. 6 10:22 - Dominika updates the vendor record and releases wire ref.\n20251106B6Q8021C004417 from the client's operating account.\n Nov. 10 - second email asks that the next payment go to the UK account. Client\ncontroller Renata Aguilar calls the real vendor contact, Wes Lindahl (cell 503\n555 0166); Mr. Lindahl says nothing has changed. Ms. Aguilar calls us at 14:10.\n Nov. 10 14:35 - recall request filed with Pemberly National Bank, fraud officer\nTrent Nilsson, case FR-2025-110932.\n\n3. Technical findings\n Compromised account: dszabo@fennimorekaplan.example, username\nFKCPA\\dszabo. Password at the time was Harvest#2024, reused on her\npersonal webmail. Reset Nov. 10.\n Her laptop FK-LT-0417 (serial PF3XK9T2, MAC 3C:52:82:9A:1F:E0, office address\n10.20.4.31) was imaged; no malware found.\n Other sign-ins came from 198.51.100.77 and 2001:db8:a41c::22. Mail was read\nfor nine days. About 72 messages with client W-9s and one payroll file were\nopened.\n The look-alike domain passed SPF and DKIM because the attacker registered\nand configured it properly.\n\n4. Bank details\n Legitimate: Vireo Bottling - routing 127024118, account 4410 882 0193.\n Fraudulent: routing 026229124, account 9900417726, in the name \"V B\nSolutions\".\n Second request: IBAN GB62NWBK88495877963232, London.\n\n5. Losses and recovery\n Wire sent: $84,310.00. Recalled Nov. 12: $52,000.00. Net exposure: $32,310.00.\n Insurer: Nettlebank Specialty Insurance Company, retention $10,000.\n Cyber policy NSI-CY-0091847\n Claim CL-25-447190\n Forensics and counsel to date: $7.5K.\n\n6. Reporting and next steps\n IC3 complaint filed 11/10/2025, no. I2511108834. Mr. Nilsson\n(trent.nilsson@pemberlynb.example) is the contact for the FBI.\n Client notified in writing Nov. 11; Howard to call Ms. Aguilar at (503) 555-0109\nabout reimbursing the net loss.\n Because client tax data was viewed, the FTC Safeguards Rule (16 C.F.R. Part\n314) and IRS Publication 4557 apply; we must also consider notice under the\nGramm-Leach-Bliley Act.\n MFA re-enabled for all 30 mailboxes. Call-back verification of any change to\npayee bank details, using a number already on file, is now mandatory.\n\nPrepared by K. Adjei - kofi@ironwoodit.example - 503.555.0184", "kind": "PDF", "detail": "2 pages · 520 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Howard Fennimore", "Kofi Adjei", "Dominika Szabo", "Renata Aguilar", "Wes Lindahl", "Trent Nilsson", "V Vireo Bottling", "V B Solutions", "Mr. Nilsson", "Howard", "Ms. Aguilar", "K. Adjei"], "companies": ["Ironwood IT Partners", "Garnet Hollow Vineyards, LLC", "Fennimore Kaplan CPAs, PLLC", "Vireo Bottling Solutions Inc.", "Pemberly National Bank", "Nettlebank Specialty Insurance Company", "IC3", "IRS"]}, "topics": {"places": ["Garnet Hollow Vineyards, LLC", "Pemberly National Bank", "Lagos, Nigeria", "UK", "London"], "health": [], "sensitive": ["passport", "credentials", "FBI", "FTC"], "names": ["Howard", "Kofi", "Dominika", "Renata", "Wes", "Trent", "V", "Mr. Nilsson", "Ms. Aguilar"]}, "chunks": 2, "chunkErrors": 0, "topicErrors": 0, "importMs": 77.09999999776483, "modelMs": 0, "topicMs": 34871, "detectors": ["email", "url", "ip", "iban", "card", "card_exp", "cvv", "ssn", "bn_ca", "sin_ca", "ein", "card_partial", "phone", "dob", "age90", "date", "passport_dl", "routing", "credential", "device", "vin", "record", "account", "money", "street", "zip", "postal_ca", "places", "names", "sensitive_topics"], "detections": [{"start": 54, "end": 70, "text": "Howard Fennimore", "kind": "person", "source": "model", "canonical": "Howard Fennimore"}, {"start": 72, "end": 88, "text": "Managing Partner", "kind": "person", "source": "short-form", "canonical": "Managing Partner"}, {"start": 96, "end": 106, "text": "Kofi Adjei", "kind": "person", "source": "model", "canonical": "Kofi Adjei"}, {"start": 108, "end": 128, "text": "Ironwood IT Partners", "kind": "company", "source": "model", "canonical": "Ironwood IT Partners"}, {"start": 137, "end": 145, "text": "IW-88213", "kind": "record", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "IW-88213"}, {"start": 154, "end": 171, "text": "November 14, 2025", "kind": "date", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "November 14, 2025"}, {"start": 227, "end": 255, "text": "Garnet Hollow\nVineyards, LLC", "kind": "company", "source": "model", "canonical": "Garnet Hollow Vineyards, LLC"}, {"start": 271, "end": 291, "text": "Thursday, November 6", "kind": "date", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "Thursday, November 6"}, {"start": 310, "end": 324, "text": "Dominika Szabo", "kind": "person", "source": "model", "canonical": "Dominika Szabo"}, {"start": 367, "end": 380, "text": "Garnet Hollow", "kind": "company",